"In an age of ephemeral data, **The Ethereal Trousseau** serves as a permanent digital sanctuary for textile artistry. It is designed to catalog, preserve, and display the silhouette of garments, stripping away the noise of the physical world to reveal the essence of the design." = "在数据转瞬即逝的时代,**空灵嫁衣** 是纺织艺术的永久数字栖居地。它用于记录、保存与展示衣物的剪影,剥离物质世界的杂音,呈现设计本身的精髓。";
"This archive utilizes on-device neural processing via Apple's Vision framework. Upon the acquisition of a new image (Capture), the system autonomously isolates the subject from its surroundings (Segmentation), centers the geometry, and mounts it upon a standardized parchment canvas. No data leaves this device; privacy is absolute." = "本档案使用 Apple Vision 框架进行端侧神经处理。获取新图像后(采集),系统会自动将主体与背景分离(分割),居中构图,再镶嵌到标准化的羊皮纸画布之上。数据不离开本机,隐私至上。";
"**To Archive:** Tap the central \"+\" button on the navigation ribbon. Choose a photograph. The automated tailor will process the garment on-device in seconds." = "**归档:** 点击导航条中央的 “+” 按钮,选择一张照片,自动裁缝会在本机数秒内完成处理。";
"**To Observe:** Browse the Collection. Tap any specimen to view the Curator's detailed remarks, edit tags, and log a wear." = "**查看:** 浏览衣橱,点击任意一件以查看策展人手记、编辑标签或记录穿着。";
